+	// For M-RoPE models (Qwen2-VL, Qwen3-VL), we need a larger batch to fit
+	// entire images. The max image size is typically 2048x2048 pixels, which
+	// with patch_size=16 and merge=2 gives (2048/16/2)^2 = 4096 tokens for
